# Secrets — real keys live here, kept out of the repo.
# Copy Secrets.example.swift → OrivioTV/Secrets.swift and fill it in.
# BOTH paths are listed deliberately: during the Nuvio→Orivio rename the file
# moved out from under a single-path rule, stopped being ignored, and got
# committed with real keys in it. Keeping the old path covers any tree that
# still has it there.
OrivioTV/Secrets.swift
NuvioTV/Secrets.swift

